Package: MiCARA
Title: Microbiome Confounder-Adjusted Robust Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Safa", "Bushnaq", , "19397747@brookes.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment=c(ORCID="0009-0000-3723-5725"))
Description: MiCARA provides a robust dual-layer framework for
    identifying disease-associated taxonomic and functional
    interaction networks from heterogeneous microbiome cohorts
    through compositional bias correction,
    mixed-effects modelling,
    confounder adjustment,
    and network inference.
